Project: CitiML to Data Catalog Integration
Team: Olympus
Lead: Rajat
Business: ISG
Provider: Olympus

This activity is specifically for CitiML integration with
Data Catalog.

This is not the CitiFIX integration activity or the NuraRec
integration activity.

The objective is to publish CitiML metadata into Data Catalog
and preserve the hierarchical relationships between CitiML
XPath nodes.

Currently, our POC is focused on:

1. Taking a sample CitiML XPath.
2. Identifying individual nodes.
3. Registering those nodes in Data Catalog.
4. Creating parent-child relationships between nodes.
5. Verifying the registered metadata and relationships.

No application development is required for the current
manual POC.


