19. RELATIONSHIP JSON FIELD EXPLANATION
============================================================

attributesSymlinks:

Array containing relationship requests.

attributesFrom:

Source attribute or parent.

attributesTo:

Target attribute or child.

paramName:

A parameter name representing the participating
attribute.

attributeLocator:

Identifies the exact attribute in Data Catalog.

Locator structure:

Business
  -> Provider
  -> Dictionary
  -> Concept
  -> Attribute

relation.type:

Type of relationship.

Our value:
LINEAGE

relation.cardinality:

Relationship cardinality.

Our value:
ANY

transformationLogic.type:

Specifies transformation relationship type.

Our value:
DIRECT

Other transformation types mentioned in the API guide:

DERIVED
CALCULATED

DIRECT is suitable for our single-source,
single-target POC links.

lineageReason.locator.portableIdentifier:

Identifier of the selected lineage reason.

lineageReason.comment:

Explanation of why we are creating the relationship.

owner:

Approved SOEID responsible for the relationship.


